%%label III. Menuet I – Menuet II – Menuet I
%%note D major, with a second minuet in D minor for two oboes and bassoon; the first returns without repeats.
X:1
T:Bach’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Menuet I – Menuet II – Menuet I
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of J. S. Bach
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:"Menuet" 1/4=132
%%score [tpt1 tpt2] timp [ob1 ob2 bn] [v1 v2 va vc cb] hpd
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:tpt1 clef=treble name="Tpt. I"
V:tpt2 clef=treble name="Tpt. II"
